OL,3,GNEWSACamden leader to stand for Keir
OL,4,AStarmer's old seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FCamden Council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali
OL,7,Fhas been selected as Labour's candidate
OL,8,Fin the by-election for Sir Keir
OL,9,FStarmer's former seat.
OL,11,FAbdi-Wali, who has led the council
OL,12,Fsince May and has been a councillor for
OL,13,FCamden Square since 2022, will stand in
OL,14,FHolborn and St Pancras on 8 October.
OL,16,FThe seat became vacant after Sir Keir,
OL,17,Fwho resigned as prime minister earlier
OL,18,Fthis year, announced on 1 September
OL,19,Fthat he was standing down as an MP,
OL,20,Fsaying it was the right time to go and
OL,21,Fto focus on international affairs.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
