OL,3,GNEWSACamden leader to stand for Keir
OL,4,AStarmer's old seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbdi-Wali said she was "delighted that
OL,7,Flocal members have put their trust in
OL,8,Fme to be Labour's candidate in the area
OL,9,FI've grown up in".
